			"notes": {
				"rationale": "es kommt auf etwas an 'what matters is' (E-VALBU ankommen, es, Lesart 2: Kprp auf + Akk, obligatory) selects an es that refers to nothing and cannot be replaced by a noun phrase, so es is the expletive member of ankommen, set as expletive Subject (de/expletive-es-joins-its-verb). an is the separable particle (de/verb-owns-its-scattered-members). The auf slot is filled by the pronominal adverb Darauf, so the valency evidence records auf + Acc with no member (de/pronominal-adverb-stands-alone). es kommt auf etw. an is DWDS ankommen 8, what something depends on or what matters, a second Reading beside 🛬, DWDS 1 'anlangen, eintreffen'. Knowledge (#887, dev draft): The expletive es is a fixed part, not a Slot."
